The upstream project retrieves current tokenized Sepehr stream URLs and
generates an M3U playlist. This project adds an always-on FastAPI proxy,
playlist and segment rewriting, browser fallback, quality controls, lazy
fetching, bounded segment caching, single-flight requests, telemetry,
embedded playback, and automated tests.

